  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Requires Umbraco CMS 18.0+. This release will not install on Umbraco 17 - the 1.x line on the main branch continues to be maintained separately for Umbraco 17.\n\n- Fixed a startup crash on SQL Server caused by a missing primary key constraint name in AddDeletionLogTableMigration (ADD CONSTRAINT [] PRIMARY KEY -> SQL error 1038). SQLite silently skipped the affected DDL, which is why it wasn't caught earlier. Fixes #2.\n\nFull release notes: https://github.com/ProWorksCorporation/ProWorks.Umbraco.MediaAudit/releases/tag/v18.0.1",
